  "body": "Stacked on #2013 (merge #2013 first)\n\n## What changed\n- Add `machining3d::rest::rough_levels` with helpers `masked_target`, `sort_dedup_heights`, `flat_floor_heights_between`, and `vertex_heights_between` in `crates/motion/src/machining3d/rest.rs`.\n- Switch `run_plain` and the coarse leg of `run_rest` in `crates/motion/src/machining3d/entry.rs` from `cut_levels_under` to `rough_levels`.\n- Remove the `#2004` `no_plane_in_hole` refusal bypass from `blind_floor::a_blind_pocket_never_enters_solid_under_any_ladder` in `crates/motion/tests/blind_floor.rs` so all 288 sweeps generate clean paths.\n- Add pinning tests `a_blind_hole_shallower_than_one_stepdown_is_cut_at_its_floor`, `a_shallow_blind_hole_beside_a_deeper_cut_is_still_cut_at_its_floor`, and `shallow_blind_hole_edge_cases_hold` in `crates/motion/tests/blind_floor.rs`.\n- Record the design decision in `docs/decisions/2088-pocket3d-shallow-blind-floor.md`.\n- Keep `pocket3d_air_split` and the half-step rest pass on `cut_levels_under`.\n\n## Cause\nPR #2013 (#2004) started `cut_levels` at `top_z - stepdown` instead of `top_z`. A blind hole shallower than one stepdown has no ladder plane between `top_z` and its floor when `bottom_z` sits at or below that floor. Isolated shallow pockets refused with `\"nothing to machine: nothing to cut: the model fills the pocket at every level\"`. Shallow blind floors inside a footprint that also covered open stock or a deeper cut were skipped.\n\n`rough_levels` inspects heights strictly between the first ladder plane and `p.top_z`. It adds up-facing horizontal floor heights whose tool-center region adds cut area not already covered below `first`. When `first` is empty and no flat floor fits, it selects the deepest cuttable triangle vertex height in that band. When a shallow flat floor is narrower than the tool, it keeps that plane so `ladder` reports `\"too narrow\"` by tool diameter.\n\n## Tests\n- **Before fix (on `base-2013` `a290caad`)**:\n  - `blind_floor::a_blind_hole_shallower_than_one_stepdown_is_cut_at_its_floor` failed with `\"nothing to machine: nothing to cut: the model fills the pocket at every level\"`.\n  - `blind_floor::a_shallow_blind_hole_beside_a_deeper_cut_is_still_cut_at_its_floor` failed with `\"blind hole must be cut: []\"`.\n- **Mutation checks**:\n  1. Reverted `crates/motion/src/machining3d/entry.rs` and `crates/motion/src/machining3d/rest.rs` to `base-2013`. Running `cargo test -p camcraft-motion --test blind_floor` failed 4 of 5 tests (`a_blind_pocket_never_enters_solid_under_any_ladder`, `a_blind_hole_shallower_than_one_stepdown_is_cut_at_its_floor`, `a_shallow_blind_hole_beside_a_deeper_cut_is_still_cut_at_its_floor`, and `shallow_blind_hole_edge_cases_hold`). Restored the fix and all 5 tests passed in 3.91s.\n  2. Forced an early return `if !empty_below { return Ok(zs); }` in `rough_levels`. Running `cargo test -p camcraft-motion --test blind_floor` failed `a_shallow_blind_hole_beside_a_deeper_cut_is_still_cut_at_its_floor` (`\"blind hole must be cut: []\"`). Restored the fix and all 5 tests passed in 3.90s.\n- **Quick gate vs stack base (`cargo xtask gate quick --base base-2013`)**: passed (2 steps, 0 failed, wall 5.0 min).\n  - `[01] motion suites`: 6 suites, 411 passed, 0 failed, 9 ignored (`--lib`: 387 passed, 6 ignored; `blind_floor`: 5/5; `islands_model_fault`: 2/2; `posed_subtract`: 1/1; `rotary_adaptive`: 3 passed, 3 ignored; `top_z_level`: 13/13).\n  - `[02] app suites` (`shared_face_bodies`): 5 passed, 0 failed.\n- **Quick gate vs upstream (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`)**:\n  - `[01] post suites`: 61 suites, 561 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored.\n  - `[02] motion suites`: 57 suites, 834 passed, 0 failed, 50 ignored (`--lib`: 6, `adaptive_hsm`: 5, `finish3d`: 33, `lead_room`: 1, `offset_shells`: 1, `pocket3d_hsm`: 1, `rotary_adaptive`: 3).\n  - `[03] motion rotary_offset (2 fn)`: 2 passed, 0 failed, 7 filtered out.\n  - `[04] app suites`: 464 suites (3338 passed, 25 failed across 10 pre-existing or sandbox targets, 34 ignored). All 25 failures belong outside #2088:\n    - `docs_troubleshooting` (1): stacked parent `base-2013` predates #2119.\n    - `mcp_live` (6): standard sandbox denied loopback TCP `connect`; re-running `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test mcp_live` outside the sandbox passed 10/10.\n    - Remaining 18 failures across 8 suites (`operations` 3, `predrilled_entry` 2, `project_roundtrip` 1, `remachining` 2, `stitch_cross` 2, `turning_face_approach` 1, `turning_face_seed` 1, `wall_arc_entry` 6) all assert old Top Z levels or refusal text on draft parent #2013 (`base-2013`). All 3D Pocket, Rest, and Blind Floor `app` suites (`blind_floor` 8/8, `pocket3d_hsm` 1/1 + 1 ignored, `pocket3d_open_side` 7/7, `pocket3d_reach` 6/6, `pocket_overhead` 2/2, `pocket_recognition` 11/11, `rest_across_setups` 7/7, `shared_face_bodies` 5/5, `suppressed_rest` 2/2, `top_z_stock_over` 2/2, `whole_model_pocket` 5/5 + 1 ignored) passed.\n- **Clippy**: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed with 0 warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone beyond stacked parent #2013 (`git diff --stat base-2013 -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n- `cargo xtask gate batch`, `cargo xtask gate release`, heavy `#[ignore]` lanes, and `crates/ui` suites did not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n- **PR #2013 (`issue/2004-top-z-level`)**: Direct stack parent (open draft). Changes `run_plain`, `run_rest`, and `pocket3d_air_split` in `crates/motion/src/machining3d/entry.rs`, plus `a_blind_pocket_never_enters_solid_under_any_ladder` in `crates/motion/tests/blind_floor.rs`. Merge #2013 first and refresh against `main`.\n- **PR #2035 (`issue/1950-adaptive-stock-ring-budget`)**: Open draft PR. Touches the same file (`crates/motion/src/machining3d/entry.rs`), different lines and function (`ladder(...)` call arguments in `run_plain`, `run_rest`, `pocket3d_air_split`, plus new `pocket3d_open_prev`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: 3D Pocket: blind holes shallower than one stepdown now cut at their floor in one level instead of refusing or being skipped.\nFixes #2088\n",
